	SAY NAME2 "Girdle of Fire Giant Strength"
	SAY DESC "Forged in volcanic depths from blackened steel and magma-tempered brass, this heavy belt pulses with intense, suffocating heat. It unleashes the fierce, militaristic power of the fire giants, flooding the wearer's veins with colossal physical strength. Embodying the indomitable nature of the forge, the artifact hardens the user's body against physical strikes and forms an absolute barrier against searing flames.

